        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "pFHO0",
          "name": "snote",
          "width": 1160,
          "height": 80,
          "content": "Staff List features:\n- A-Z quick filter on username field, with text search\n- 10-column grid: firstName, lastName, state, shift, appointment, therapy, lastReminder, 2FA (lock icon), enabled (lightbulb)\n- Row selection enables: Edit, Onboarding, Assignments, Password, Invoice buttons\n- Always enabled: Add, Export, Expert Search\n- Row double-click opens inline detail panel (shared profile form)\n- Right-side filter panel (@shadcn/sheet): name, email, job autocomplete, skill autocomplete\n- Data source: UserService.getExperts with client-side search on firstName/lastName/email"
        }
      ]
