        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "hKePp",
          "name": "wnote",
          "width": 660,
          "height": 80,
          "content": "Week Grid (Expert Week):\n- 24 rows (hours 01:00-24:00) x 7 day columns (Mon-Sun)\n- Binary state cells: null (X, no color) -> true (green check) -> null\n- Click interactions: cell (single slot), hour label (equalize 7 slots), column header (equalize column)\n- Type selector: only TREATMENT currently\n- Locked cells checked via .locked CSS class\n- Known bug: slotsSo (server) vs slotsSu (UI) naming mismatch for Sunday\n- ExpertWeekService.getUser/save"
        }
      ]
    },
